          ],
          "type" : "paragraph"
        },
        {
          "inlineContent" : [
            {
              "text" : "Design plane has several methods related to application use of selection for inspection",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
              "text" : " ",
              "type" : "text"
            },
            {
